      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "[*Jhoren stares at you quietly, and after several long moments he inclines his head.*]\n If you are so fueled to experience some form of adventure, then I might request that you venture out to a nearby cave. A word of warning, however, it is quite dangerous.",
