      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "There is a particular source of power that I am most interested in. Thus far, any attempt at investigation has resulted in silence. Should you find this source, and return to me with it in hand, I would surely pay you appropriately.",
